@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = 替换为你的用户 token
@gameId = 替换为创建牌局返回的 id
@playerId = 替换为添加玩家返回列表中的 players[0].id
@teamId = seed_team_allinle

### create personal ledger game
POST {{baseUrl}}/ledger/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PERSONAL",
  "title": "周末练习局",
  "blindLevel": "1/2",
  "gameDate": "2026-07-07",
  "note": "个人记录"
}

### add player
POST {{baseUrl}}/ledger/games/{{gameId}}/players
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "我"
}

### add buy in
POST {{baseUrl}}/ledger/games/{{gameId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "type": "BUY_IN",
  "amount": 1000,
  "note": "初始买入"
}

### add cash out
POST {{baseUrl}}/ledger/games/{{gameId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "type": "CASH_OUT",
  "amount": 1500,
  "note": "结束带出"
}

### finish game
POST {{baseUrl}}/ledger/games/{{gameId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### confirm game
POST {{baseUrl}}/ledger/games/{{gameId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "确认无误"
}

### create team ledger game
POST {{baseUrl}}/ledger/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TEAM",
  "teamId": "{{teamId}}",
  "title": "团队记账测试",
  "blindLevel": "1/2",
  "gameDate": "2026-07-07",
  "note": "团队记录"
}

### list ledger games
GET {{baseUrl}}/ledger/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

